-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-Party Attributions, Inspirations & Acknowledgments
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

RACASO builds upon, adapts, and synthesizes key foundational concepts from the
following optimization frameworks and algorithms:

1. CASPR (Cautious Adaptive Second-order Preconditioned Regularizer)
   - Foundational architectural intuition bridging second-order cautious step bounds with structured preconditioning.

2. SOAP (Second-Order Optimization via Kronecker Preconditioning)
   - Authors: Nikhil Vyas, Depen Morwani, Rosie Zhao, Gal Kaplun, Sham Kakade, Boaz Barak (2024)
   - License: MIT License
   - Citation: arXiv:2409.11321

2. Sophia (Scalable Stochastic Second-order Optimizer)
   - Authors: Hong Liu, Zhiyuan Li, David Hall, Percy Liang, Tengyu Ma (2023)
   - License: MIT License
   - Citation: arXiv:2305.14342

3. Shampoo (Preconditioned Stochastic Tensor Optimization)
   - Authors: Vineet Gupta, Tomer Koren, Yoram Singer (2018)
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Citation: arXiv:1802.09568

4. AdaHessian (Adaptive Second Order Optimizer)
   - Authors: Zhewei Yao, Amir Gholami, Sheng Shen, Mustafa Mustafa, Kurt Keutzer, Michael W. Mahoney (2020)
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Citation: arXiv:2006.00719

5. RAdam (Rectified Adam / Variance Confidence Gating)
   - Authors: Liyuan Liu, Haoming Jiang, Pengcheng He, Weizhu Chen, Xiaodong Liu, Jianfeng Gao, Jiawei Han (2019)
   - License: Apache License 2.0 / MIT
   - Citation: arXiv:1908.03265

6. Yogi (Additive Variance Tracking)
   - Authors: Manzil Zaheer, Sashank J. Reddi, Devendra Sachan, Satyen Kale, Sanjiv Kumar (2018)
   - License: Apache License 2.0 / MIT
   - Citation: NeurIPS 2018
